{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:23:00+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA", "steam_appid": 1372280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1590580, 1645470, 1645450, 1645540, 1645452, 1645460, 1645480, 1645510, 1645520, 1645490, 1645500, 1649930, 1645530, 1645550, 1810560, 1810562, 1918661, 1918663, 2111970, 2111960, 2172450, 2172460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6th October 2025 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MELTY BLOOD ARCHIVES has been updated to address the recently identified Unity vulnerability. Please note that MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA was not developed using Unity. Therefore, it is not affected by this vulnerability and does not require an update.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>MELTY BLOOD is reborn. </i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon, this is new 2D fighting game, featuring new scenarios and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Iconic Battle Systems</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the systems inherited from the MELTY BLOOD series, it has new systems such as Moon Skill, that unleashes powerful techniques with simple inputs. We have pursued a battle system that allows you to enjoy intense battles with simple controls, that can be enjoyed not only by experienced players, but also by beginners who will touch MELTY BLOOD for the first time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.poster.avif?t=1759740620\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.webm?t=1759740620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.mp4?t=1759740620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Online battles using Rollback Netcode</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA utilizes Rollback Netcode for stable online battles against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ All-New Stories, Visuals, &amp; Characters</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an all-new MELTY BLOOD world from scenario writer Kinoko Nasu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique story events for each character give each playthrough its own feel, adding to the overall experience. The dialogue is fully voiced and changes depending on the combination of characters during battle, giving more insight into their relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the visuals have been renewed for the HD environment. And each character's special move has beautiful animation produced by A-1 Pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Rich Customization &amp; Gallery Feature</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your title, profile icon, and character outfits for battle. They can even be used in online matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect visuals, opening cinematics, music tracks, voices, pixel art, and more in the gallery. You’ll even be able to look at guest illustrations created by artists connected to TYPE-MOON titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Easy-to-play game structure for beginners to advanced players</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to tutorials where you can learn the basics of the game, we also have missions for each character for those who want to further master the game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6th October 2025 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>MELTY BLOOD ARCHIVES has been updated to address the recently identified Unity vulnerability. Please note that MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA was not developed using Unity. Therefore, it is not affected by this vulnerability and does not require an update.</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>MELTY BLOOD is reborn. </i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon, this is new 2D fighting game, featuring new scenarios and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Iconic Battle Systems</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the systems inherited from the MELTY BLOOD series, it has new systems such as Moon Skill, that unleashes powerful techniques with simple inputs. We have pursued a battle system that allows you to enjoy intense battles with simple controls, that can be enjoyed not only by experienced players, but also by beginners who will touch MELTY BLOOD for the first time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.poster.avif?t=1759740620\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.webm?t=1759740620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/extras/8493436f111f88d13b786fb861533960.mp4?t=1759740620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Online battles using Rollback Netcode</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA utilizes Rollback Netcode for stable online battles against other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ All-New Stories, Visuals, &amp; Characters</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an all-new MELTY BLOOD world from scenario writer Kinoko Nasu. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique story events for each character give each playthrough its own feel, adding to the overall experience. The dialogue is fully voiced and changes depending on the combination of characters during battle, giving more insight into their relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the visuals have been renewed for the HD environment. And each character's special move has beautiful animation produced by A-1 Pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Rich Customization &amp; Gallery Feature</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your title, profile icon, and character outfits for battle. They can even be used in online matches! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect visuals, opening cinematics, music tracks, voices, pixel art, and more in the gallery. You’ll even be able to look at guest illustrations created by artists connected to TYPE-MOON titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>◆ Easy-to-play game structure for beginners to advanced players</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to tutorials where you can learn the basics of the game, we also have missions for each character for those who want to further master the game!</p>", "short_description": "This is the latest addition to the series of 2D fighting games based on TYPE-MOON's visual novel, Tsukihime. The curtain rises once more on dramatic battles played out with familiar characters from Tsukihime: A Piece of Blue Glass Moon.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean, French, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/header.jpg?t=1759740620", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/90b97096069131a7891b9855efd1d0bf144c72b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759740620", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1372280/90b97096069131a7891b9855efd1d0bf144c72b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759740620", "website": "https://meltyblood.typelumina.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5, 3.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 680 / Radeon HD 7970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 12 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Display Resolution 1280x720 and above recommended.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "©TYPE-MOON / Project LUMINA", "developers": ["FRENCH-BREAD", "TYPE-MOON", "Lasengle Inc.", "TAMSOFT CORPORATION", "GameLoop Inc."], "publishers": ["Lasengle Inc."], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 4999, "final": 1499, "discount_percent": 70, "initial_formatted": "$49.99", "final_formatted": "$14.99"}, "packages": [481351, 1039339], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy MELTY BLOOD: TYPE LUMINA", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid